                                "sense_id": "6101ebdd-2455-3ee8-b8fa-a537141fd9e7",
                                "text": "Or the merely verbal pressure of jawbonings by prominent people may try to silence a certain point of view."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cf230f1-8598-44e8-b1ee-ed876b014d9d",
                                "sense_id": "6101ebdd-2455-3ee8-b8fa-a537141fd9e7",
                                "text": "It's shocking to Douek, because she is a close-watcher of what's known as \"jawboning,\" when regulators or government officials pressure private actors, like a social media company or broadcast network, to stifle speech. The libertarian Cato Institute calls the practice \"censorship by proxy.\""
                            }
                        ]
